wf-asf-company-description = The Astraeus Solar Federation is a union of many species that happens to include the Sol system. The moth fleets ended humanity's last great war and offered it a seat at the table; humans are one member among many, not the ones in charge. Its handful of envoys in this sector are here to help, listen and keep a door open, and they get along with the Trans-Solar Federation better than two governments claiming the same star have any right to.

ent-WFAsfClothingUniformService = ASF service uniform
    .desc = The purple tunic and dark trousers of the Astraeus Solar Federation, cut to be let out or taken in for whichever species ends up wearing it.
ent-WFAsfClothingHeadBeret = ASF beret
    .desc = A purple beret with the Federation's star pinned to the front.
ent-WFAsfClothingOuterGreatcoat = ASF greatcoat
    .desc = A heavy aubergine greatcoat with gold shoulder boards, worn by Federation envoys who expect to be standing in a cold docking bay for a while.
ent-WFAsfBanner = Astraeus Solar Federation banner
    .desc = The purple standard of the Astraeus Solar Federation.
ent-WFAsfMarineBanner = ASF Marine Corps banner
    .desc = The standard of the Federation's marines, who mostly turn up to pull people out of trouble.
